      "text": "Customer endpoints\n\nPOST /api/auth/login\nGET  /api/me\nGET  /api/transactions\nPOST /api/transactions/lookup  {transactionId}\nGET  /api/disputes\nPOST /api/disputes  (Idempotency-Key)\nPOST /api/disputes/lookup  {disputeId}\nPOST /api/disputes/withdraw  {disputeId, note}\nGET  /api/dispute-reasons · GET /health",
