      "text": "PostgreSQL 16 · host port 5433\n\nCustomers · Transactions · Disputes · DisputeStatusHistory\n\n• one active dispute per transaction (filtered unique index)\n• unique (CustomerId, IdempotencyKey)\n• xmin row version → concurrent edit = 409\n• dispute_number_seq for dispute numbers\n• migrations applied at startup · demo seed in Development only",
